What is Python?
- Python is a high-level programming language.
- It is easy to read, write, and learn because its syntax looks like plain English.
- Python is interpreted (runs line by line), object-oriented, and open-source.
- It is widely used in web development, data science, machine learning, automation, scripting, and system design.

- Python एक programming language है जो बहुत आसान और readable है।
- इसका syntax (rules) almost English जैसा है, इसलिए beginners जल्दी सीख लेते हैं।
- Python को line-by-line execute किया जाता है (interpreted language)।
- इसका use web apps बनाने, data analysis करने, machine learning, AI, automation, scripting और बहुत सारे fields में होता है

